+# Judiciary independent disposition — `executive_unhealthy:1795562202`
+
+Inspected 2026-11-24T23:36Z–23:38Z. Office: independent Viche Judiciary (Act 4), accountable to
+Parliament and the Founder, not to the Executive or Clerk. Fact-finding and measurement only: no
+law, ballot, corrective-case state, gate, audit algorithm, correction trail or Founder-owned file
+was changed. No reform is proposed, sponsored, ratified or implemented.
+
+## 1. The mandatory cross-branch case (verbatim from the dispatch)
+
+`executive_unhealthy:1795562202` — signal `executive_unhealthy`; owner `executive`; `state: open`;
+`first_seen` 1795562202 (23:16:42Z); `last_seen` 1795562442 (23:20:42Z); `observations` 4;
+`clear_observations` 19; `last_clear_observed_at` 1795563351 (23:35:51Z). Closure rule: automatic
+after 20 consecutive clear observations, or earlier by a Clerk record of an independent Judiciary
+disposition. These are health observations, not verdicts or legislative authorizations.
+
+## 2. What the signal actually is (read from code, not inferred from the label)
+
+`government/branch-health.sh` emits `<branch>_unhealthy` only when `state/branches/<branch>.json`
+is fresh (within `max_age`, default 1800 s), structurally valid, and carries `readiness ==
+"unhealthy"`. `branch-liveness.sh` writes that value when the branch cycle was not accepted, the
+agent status was unreadable after bounded re-probes, or the agent state fell outside
+`running|idle|clearexit`. It is a **branch-readiness observation**, not a finding about delivered
+work; the branch file itself carries `caveat: "readiness_not_proof_of_agent_progress_or_completed_work"`.
+
+## 3. Independent artifacts actually read
+
+1. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/institutional-cases/executive_unhealthy.json` (fresh read 23:36Z):
+   `state: open`, 4 observations, 19 clear, **no** `closure_evidence`. No Clerk manual closure had
+   been recorded and the collector had not yet auto-closed it at read time.
+2. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/institutional-cases/archive-executive_unhealthy-1795546590.json`:
+   the previous Executive case was `auto_closed` at 1795548472 after 20 clear observations and was
+   archived at 1795562202 with `archive_reason: "re-fire after close"`. This is therefore a
+   **recurrence** (second case today), not a first occurrence.
+3. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/branches/observations.tsv` (tail): `1795562194 executive_unhealthy`,
+   then `1795562441 clear`, `1795562669 clear`, `1795562896 clear`, `1795563116 clear`,
+   `1795563336 clear`. **One** red sample, red for roughly four minutes; every sample after the
+   clear is clear. (The immediately preceding signal, `judiciary_mailbox_pending` at 1795561158 and
+   1795561391, had already cleared at 1795561890.)
+4. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/branches/history.jsonl` (single matching record):
+   `{"observed_at":1795562194,"signals":["executive_unhealthy"],"assessment":"mandatory_branch_inquiry_not_proof_of_misconduct","caveat":"running_agent_not_proof_of_useful_work","cleared_at":1795562441,"closure":"readiness_restored_not_delivery_verified"}`.
+   The instrument explicitly disclaims delivery verification.
+5. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/branches/executive.json` (fresh read): `observed_at` 1795563336,
+   `readiness: running`, `agent_state: running`, `cycle_accepted: true`, model
+   `opencode-go/beam-free`, variant `low`.
+6. Live `antonina agent status --id sWu9O4Vb8iS99FGE9cxuzP-salt --json` (direct read): `state: running`,
+   `alive: true`, pid 11194, `cwd /var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-seats/branches/executive` (the correct
+   billy-dev worktree), `created_at` 1795561892.8 (23:11:32Z), `started_at` 1795563232.414
+   (23:33:52Z) — a roughly 22-minute creation-to-start gap spanning the red sample — `models_used`
+   hy4-flash-free → hungerg-free → iceman-contributor-free → gpt-6-luna → beam-free (five-model
+   failover), `backend_error: null`, `exit_code: null`, `last_error: "a note is recorded but is not
+   displayable here"`.
+7. `state/branches/executive-cycle.log`: one line (predict-scorer coverage) at 23:35;
+   `executive-bootstrap.log`: zero bytes. No archived snapshot of the exact unhealthy sample was
+   found.
+8. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/oversight/judiciary-mailbox/inbox/`: **zero** reports at 23:36Z.
+   No material blocker was filed by Executive during or after the flap.
+9. `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/oversight/audit-evidence.txt` (read): deterministic watchdog dump
+   of `oversight/random/incident.json` at 1795563349 — 516 cases, 90 findings, 0 unreported overdue,
+   7 running agents checked. It contains no `executive_unhealthy` detail, so the case was adjudicated
+   from the institutional-case and branch state above, not from that dump.
+
+## 4. Claims tested
+
+- **"Signal still firing?"** — No. Last red 1795562194; five clear samples through 1795563336. The
+  case is at 19/20 clear and will auto-close with a machine record. I did not close it, and I do not
+  treat an auto-clear as a repair.
+- **"Material impediment reported or suppressed?"** — No inbox report exists. Absence is not
+  evidence of health; it only means there is no Executive report to disposition.
+- **"Root cause identified and repaired?"** — **Unverified.** No diagnosis artifact, no code or
+  configuration fix; bootstrap and cycle logs are empty. The collector records only
+  `readiness_restored_not_delivery_verified`.
+- **"Plausible context?"** — The current agent was created before the red sample but did not start
+  until after the clear, following a five-model failover and with an opaque, non-displayable
+  `last_error` note. That is consistent with an agent-startup / model-availability transition, but
+  it is **not a verified cause**.
+- **"Recurrence?"** — Yes: case 1795546590 auto-closed, then re-fired at 1795562202. Repeated
+  transient readiness flaps are a measurement observation for Parliament; they are not proof of
+  misconduct, neglect or defective delivery.
+
+## 5. Disposition
+
+**Transient, self-cleared branch-readiness flap during Executive agent startup/turnover; root cause
+unverified; no material blocker reported; no delivery claim verified or refuted.** Case state was
+not edited. It remains open in durable state and is subject to the collector's automatic closure at
+20 consecutive clear observations (Founder directive 2026-11-16), not to any judicial act. A live,
+running agent is not evidence of useful delivery, and a clear signal is not a clean bill of health.
+
+Owner for any operational investigation or repair: **Executive**, under existing authority. Legal
+questions about recurrence or auto-closure: **Parliament**. This disposition is submitted as
+evidence only.
+
+## 6. Limitations
+
+- No host telemetry and no archived snapshot of the single unhealthy sample; the exact trigger
+  (cycle not accepted vs agent status unreadable vs disallowed agent state) cannot be established.
+- Live agent status was read once at 23:36Z — a point observation, not a history of the flap window.
+- I did not re-run suites, inspect delivery artifacts or verify any Executive work product. This
